  "body": "Privately positioned in one of Castor Bay’s most desirable locations, this charming weatherboard home offers space, sunshine and relaxed coastal living on a generous 832m² freehold section.\r\n\r\nSet well back from the road and surrounded by established greenery, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy, with a versatile layout offering three to four bedrooms and two separate living areas. Whether accommodating a growing family, teenagers, guests or working from home, there is flexibility here to suit a variety of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, open-plan living and dining connect seamlessly to expansive, sun-soaked decks, creating the perfect setting for entertaining, outdoor dining or simply unwinding in the sunshine. Beyond, the lush native garden provides a peaceful natural backdrop, with plenty of space for children and pets to play and garden enthusiasts to enjoy.\r\n\r\nWarm and welcoming, the home combines generous proportions with comfortable family living, offering room for everyone to spread out while still enjoying those important moments together.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing. Castor Bay Beach is nearby, while Milford and Takapuna provide an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, shopping and everyday amenities. Auckland’s CBD is also easily accessible, and families will appreciate the sought-after local school zones.\r\n\r\nWith our vendors committed to their next move, this is an exciting opportunity to secure a substantial freehold property in one of the North Shore’s most tightly held coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nSpace, privacy, sunshine and an enviable coastal setting — discover the lifestyle that makes Castor Bay so special.\r\n\r\nCome and experience it for yourself.",
